; -----------------------------------------------------------------------
; Map Hub -- real community browse/download screen consuming net/net_client.gd
; (WP-M). Re-fetched and verified against "Octet - Map Hub.dc.html" live from
; the Claude Design MCP (project cc6f9e35-9183-4b42-8d8a-be6dfc135fe1): header
; chrome, 5-col grid, and the detail view's two-column layout (left info+
; actions column with a border-right hairline, right a fixed 640px leaderboard
; panel) all match the mockup's structure/spacing/colour directly.
;
; Colours baked as literal DesignTokens values for the header chrome below
; (.tscn parses before autoloads exist, same documented exception as
; game/song_select.tscn); everything below the header is styled at runtime
; via map_hub.gd since it's data-driven (grid cards, difficulty chips, stat
; blocks, detail cover):
;   COLOR_INK             #0C0A0F -> Color(0.047, 0.039, 0.059, 1)
;   COLOR_SURFACE         #16131B -> Color(0.086275, 0.07451, 0.105882, 1)
;   COLOR_HAIRLINE        #2A2431 -> Color(0.164706, 0.141176, 0.192157, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_PRIMARY    #F5F1F5 -> Color(0.960784, 0.945098, 0.960784, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_SECONDARY  #A79FAE -> Color(0.654902, 0.623529, 0.682353, 1)
;   COLOR_TEXT_MUTED      #6E6676 -> Color(0.431373, 0.4, 0.462745, 1)
;
; Known, explicitly flagged deviations (see map_hub.gd for the full reasoning):
; leaderboard is an honest "coming soon" label, never fabricated sample rows;
; Preview is disabled until a map is actually downloaded, then plays the
; local audio; the Filters chip is present but intentionally left unwired
; (disabled + tooltip) rather than building a full filter panel this pass;
; the stats row shows Rating + Downloads only -- the manifest has no distinct
; "plays" field separate from download_count.
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------

